---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="InfraTrove is a growing collection of small, free browser-based tools for everyday technical work."
>
  <article class="container prose">
    <div class="eyebrow">Small tools. Less friction.</div>
    <h1>Built for the little tasks.</h1>
    <p>
      InfraTrove brings everyday developer utilities together in one
      straightforward place. Format a response, compare a config, decode a
      string or generate an identifier without creating an account.
    </p>
    <h2>Useful before anything else</h2>
    <p>
      Each tool focuses on one task with clear controls, examples and documented
      limits. Tool input is processed in your browser. We do not run an
      input-processing backend, ad scripts or analytics scripts in this release.
    </p>
    <h2>Free to use</h2>
    <p>
      Core tools are free and require no login. Advertising may support suitable
      pages in the future. Any change to data handling will be reflected in the
      privacy policy.
    </p>
    <p>
      Have a correction or a suggestion? See the{' '}
      <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
